  m_Name: Act 3 NPC Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - '"AHHH"'
  - Hello, are you ok?
  - '"Please, you need to get out of here"'
  - What's happening to you?
  - '"I was attacked by the Resonants."'
  - '"My family escaped, but I was bitten."'
  - '"You must leave before I fully turn."'
  - '"There is a colony far west from here."'
  - '"I see you have a map already..."'
  - '"... make sure to use it!"'
  - "\"If you can make it there, you\u2019ll be safe.\""
  - "\"It\u2019s happening. Quickly, GO!\""
  - '"Get away from here."'
